From 2e1495abb4112b874e7e04dc2a834c5ea7ce8117 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex6357 <73743056+Alex6357@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 20:42:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rc-mountd: integrate TrueNAS rc framework + NFS export
 robustness on 15.1

Integration of TrueNAS rc/mountd patches rebased onto FreeBSD 15.1:
- 05fb1b1a812 Import rc.dynamicdiskless (new file, from TrueOS 12-stable)
- 520e9fdb52d Re-enable rc.dynamicdiskless via /etc/dynamicdiskless flag
- a93e963fd08 Comment out force_depends in mountd/nfsd rc scripts
  (avoid confusing FreeNAS/TrueNAS middleware orchestration)
- b6aaab1b019 Remove excessive devd dependencies (REQUIRE: netif ldconfig)
  (break ix-syncdisks circular dependency)
- c7df8b01582 Bump default TMPFS size to physmem/1536 (~1/3 RAM)
- bcb2a2df228 Allow zvol name to have space/double quotation mark
  (NOTE: kern_conf prep_devname change is applied in kernel-misc group)

NOTE: rc.subr/rc.subr.8 NOT touched here -- the only os change to those
is abf14b58ac7 (revert MFC r351863), handled separately in the optional
group as a conflict-point decision (15.1 upstream retains that MFC).

Rebase notes vs 15.1: all rc scripts merged cleanly (0 conflicts); only
rc.subr would conflict and is intentionally left at 15.1 baseline.
